There is already a purpose-built `codex-auto-fetched-snapshot-sweep.mjs` script for this exact lane: it claims unprocessed snapshot files, extracts first-pass PDF text concurrently, DOI-checks existing source pages, and appends rollup/skip dispositions. I’m going to use it for the triage phase, then manually inspect any `real-ingest` candidates it leaves.
