islam2023-noakhali-spices-bangladesh,wiki/sources,KADC_02-chowdhury-2023-heavy-metals-spices-bangladesh,bf502fe,2026-06-02T05:30:00Z,audited-revised,REVISE,2026-06-02,"Manual-fetch v2 fresh new-page ingest; KADC condiments2_papers/04_Chocolate_Seasonings_Salt/02. medRxiv preprint 2023; DOI 10.1101/2023.02.06.23285555; CC-BY-4.0. Islam MS, Chowdhury AI, Shill LC, Reza S, Alam MR (Noakhali Sci & Tech Univ + Univ Dhaka). Note: folder filename credits Chowdhury but first author is Islam — cite-key follows first-author convention. n=19 commercial spice samples (15 non-branded, 4 branded) from Sonapur/Maijdee marketplaces Noakhali District Bangladesh; PerkinElmer PinAAcle 900H AAS triplicate after 1:4 HNO₃:H₂SO₄ wet digestion at 130°C; metals Pb/Cd/Cr-total/Cu/Fe; EDI/THQ/TTHQ/CR risk per USEPA+WHO RfDs; household IR survey n=180 across six clusters. Cu and Fe correctly excluded from HMI metals scope (non-HMTc-10). Cr is total Cr — Cr-VI speciation discipline flagged in Key numbers, Methods, Implications, and Verification notes (4 explicit speciation guards). Paper-internal Fe labeling contradiction noted: text says Black Pepper highest at 9.29 mg/kg but immediately lists green-chili 35.46 and chili-powder 34.02; Figure 2(e) confirms Black Pepper is actually lowest. Brand firewall clean (no brand names; 'branded'/'non-branded' are structural categories the paper itself uses). Part 2 firewall clean (n=1-per-category limit explicitly written into Implications to prevent threshold-math overreach). SHA256 3165838e...e271b25. Audit subagent (general-purpose fresh context) verdict REVISE; 1 ❌ applied + 2 ⚠️ applied + 0 rejected. ❌ Check 1: original CR > 1×10⁻⁴ list included S-10 coriander-powder alongside the 8 samples authors enumerate (turmeric/chili branded+unbranded, green chili, masala mix, ginger, coriander leaf); page-14 narrative + Figure 3 visual confirm S-10 is below benchmark; S-10 removed. ⚠️ Check 1 (×2): Cd 1.65±0.011 vs ±0.01 and Fe 9.29±1.71 vs ±1.72 are source's own abstract-vs-Results SD mismatch; reconciled in table to Results precision with Verification note recording the abstract figures for traceability. Checks 2 (slug vocab), 3 (speciation/methods PinAAcle 900H verified pg 7), 4 (brand firewall), 5 (Part 2 firewall) all clean ✅. Ingest commit bf502fe; audit-application commit f496c6c. Routing: 1 product-page row generated; 0 unresolved, 0 malformed for this source."
